  "instructions": [
    "prepare the donabe by washing it with warm water and drying thoroughly.",
    "in a small bowl, mix together the soy sauce, brown rice, and sesame oil.",
    "add the zucchini and green onions to the bowl and toss to combine.",
    "place the scottish smoked salmon fillets in the donabe.",
    "add the chili flakes, salt, and black pepper to the donabe and toss to combine.",
    "add the water to the donabe and bring to a boil over high heat.",
    "reduce the heat to low and cover the donabe with a lid.",
    "simmer for 10 minutes, or until the salmon is cooked through.",
    "serve the salmon and rice mixture hot, garnished with toasted sesame seeds if desired.",
    "serve with a side of steamed vegetables or a simple salad."
